OL,3,CWhich parts of the UK will have the
OL,4,Cbest weather for the solar eclipse?
OL,6,FThe UK will see its fullest solar
OL,7,Feclipse for the next 54 years on
OL,8,FWednesday.
OL,10,FMore than 90% of the Sun will be
OL,11,Fobscured by the Moon between 6.17pm
OL,12,Fand 8.06pm on August 12, the most it
OL,13,Fhas been blocked above UK skies since
OL,14,Fthe total eclipse in 1999.
OL,16,FITV Weather's Lucy Verasamy breaks
OL,17,Fdown what the weather will be like for
OL,18,FWednesday's solar eclipse.
OL,20,FHave you got your solar eclipse
OL,21,Fglasses ready?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
