OL,3,CWhich parts of the UK will have the
OL,4,Cbest weather for the solar eclipse?
OL,6,FThe last major solar eclipse in August
OL,7,F1999 happened in the middle of the
OL,8,Fday. But this one will be peaking in
OL,9,Fthe evening, when the sun is lower in
OL,10,Fthe sky.
OL,12,FThe advice is to find somewhere with
OL,13,Fheight with a view of the western
OL,14,Fhorizon.
OL,16,FWhere will we see the clearest skies
OL,17,Ffor the best view?
OL,19,FThere will be more cloud expected
OL,20,Facross northern and north-west
OL,21,FScotland and Northern Ireland.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
