OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786490291
OL,3,CWhich parts of the UK will have the
OL,4,Cbest weather for the solar eclipse?
OL,6,FHere the clouds will not only obstruct
OL,7,Fthis rare view but also bring
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain from the Atlantic to
OL,9,Fexposed areas.
OL,11,FParts of north-western England
OL,12,Fincluding Cumbria, Lancashire and
OL,13,Fparts of north-west Wales will also be
OL,14,Fprone to more cloud, making any late
OL,15,Fsun visibility very limited.
OL,17,FThe rest of the UK is looking much
OL,18,Fclearer with a better chance of seeing
OL,19,Fthis special solar spectacle.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
