OL,3,CWhich parts of the UK will have the
OL,4,Cbest weather for the solar eclipse?
OL,6,FHow about visibility for shooting
OL,7,Fstars?
OL,9,FThere'll Perseids meteor shower - or
OL,10,Fshooting stars - a few hours after the
OL,11,Fsolar eclipse.
OL,13,FThis is an annual event and stretches
OL,14,Ffrom mid July to mid August, peaking
OL,15,Faround now.
OL,17,FThis year is particularly good for
OL,18,Fvisibility as we are currently in a
OL,19,F"new moon" phase - providing darker
OL,20,Fskies without the moonlight.
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
