OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786490291
OL,3,CWhich parts of the UK will have the
OL,4,Cbest weather for the solar eclipse?
OL,6,FThese Perseids meteors can be seen
OL,7,Ftonight - but also have been active in
OL,8,Fprevious nights and also during the
OL,9,Fnext few nights - so we're not limited
OL,10,Fto one chance and will happen over a
OL,11,Flonger time frame.
OL,13,FSimilarly to the forecast cloud cover
OL,14,Ffor the solar eclipse, the meteor
OL,15,Fshowers will have limited visibility
OL,16,Ffor the north-west of Scotland,
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland and north-west
OL,18,FEngland - but here there will be some
OL,19,Fclearer breaks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
